MODIFICATIONS
    This extended edition adds AI-powered features to the original project,
    including right-click context menu integration for:
    - AI Brainstorming
    - AI Research
    - AI Concept Explanation
    - AI Text Polishing
    - AI Summarization
    - AI Restructuring

